        ],
        "default": [
          {
            "title": "Life Sciences",
            "content": "<p>We partner with life sciences organizations to accelerate growth, drive real-world impact, and show up with precision and proof when it matters most. We know how to build value with speed across clinical trial milestones, advocacy and engagement, launches, corporate narrative, and executive visibility ? bringing evidence-led storytelling to work that helps remove barriers to care.</p>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Health Innovation",
            "content": "<p>We help innovators blend health and technology by building the credibility that drives adoption, grounded in evidence, informed by modern tools including AI, and executed with the precision healthcare demands. We know how to take a story from breakthrough technology to clinical workflow to payer acceptance.</p>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Business of Health",
            "content": "<p>We understand the realities of patient, provider, and payor dynamics ? from reimbursement pressure and value-based care to the operational complexity of healthcare delivery. Our positioning and go-to-market strategies reflect how decisions actually get made, so organizations can earn trust, unlock adoption, and build sustainable growth.</p>"
          }
        ]
      },
